### Bad Code API Testing
### Use this file with Visual Studio's REST Client (Ctrl+Alt+E)

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7030
@contentType = application/json

### ========================================
### Discovery Endpoint
### ========================================

### Get all available endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast/demo-endpoints HTTP/1.1

