### ========================================
### Specific Bad Code Tests
### ========================================

### SQL Injection - Normal ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast/get-user/1 HTTP/1.1

### SQL Injection - Attack Attempt
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast/get-user/1%20OR%201%3D1 HTTP/1.1

### Input Processing Without Validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast/process-input HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "input": "admin:admin@example.com"
}

### String Concatenation Performance Test
POST {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast/build-string HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

[
  "item1",
  "item2",
  "item3",
  "item4",
  "item5"
]

### Division - Valid Input
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast/divide/10/2 HTTP/1.1

### Division - Division by Zero (Error Expected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast/divide/10/0 HTTP/1.1

### ========================================
### Original Endpoint (For Reference)
### ========================================

### Get Weather Forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/weatherforecast HTTP/1.1
